<out>/stub-src/u-boot-<ver>, never in <out>/src) and compiled only with
-DFUZZ_CRYPTO_STUB. stub.sh names the symbol and banner CI looks for.

--- a/lib/rsa/rsa-verify.c
+++ b/lib/rsa/rsa-verify.c
@@ -25,6 +25,39 @@
 /* Default public exponent for backward compatibility */
